<title>USA: Roosevelt Financial expands shr repurchase.</title>
<headline>Roosevelt Financial expands shr repurchase.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Roosevelt Financial Group Inc said Thursday it has expanded its stock repurchase plan by about 5.5 million shares to 7.0 million shares.  </p>
<p>The increased repurchase authorization was part of the thrift holding company's agreement to be acquired by Mercantile Bancorp Inc.</p>
<p>That $1.07 billion agreement was announced December 23.</p>
<p>Roosevelt said it had agreed to use its best reasonable efforts to repurchase the 7.0 million shares prior to the closing of the merger, which is expected to be completed in mid-1997.</p>
<p>Shares of Roosevelt closed down 1/2 at 20-1/2 Thursday.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
